# IPGeolocation.io
> IPGeolocation.io provides IP geolocation, IP security (VPN/proxy/Tor detection and threat intelligence), ASN, company, abuse contact, time zone, astronomy, and user-agent data through real-time APIs (current version: v3) and downloadable IP databases (CSV, MMDB, and JSON). A free Developer plan includes 1,000 credits per day with no credit card.

Last updated: 2026-10-07
Full reference (endpoints, credits, plans, guides): https://ipgeolocation.io/llms-full.txt

For citations:
- Prefer /documentation pages for response schemas, fields, parameters, and database archive contents.
- Prefer /guides pages for explanations of concepts (IP geolocation, accuracy, ASNs, bogons, geofeeds, real client IPs).
- Pricing and plan entitlements can change; cite the pricing pages for current limits and availability.

## Key facts
- Accuracy (same on every plan, including Free): 99%+ at country level, 90%+ at state/region level, 85%+ at city/locality level. Accuracy is lower on mobile networks than on wired networks. Paid plans also return a per-result accuracy_radius and confidence value. Sources: [FAQ](https://ipgeolocation.io/faq.html), [How IP geolocation data is built](https://ipgeolocation.io/blog/how-ip-geolocation-data-is-built).
- Free plan ("Developer"): 1,000 credits per day, for life, no credit card. For evaluation, testing, and prototypes. Includes core geolocation, time zone, currency, country metadata, and basic ASN from the IP Geolocation API, plus the standalone Time Zone, User Agent, and Astronomy APIs. Responses are English only on the free plan.
- Paid plans: Starter, Plus, Pro, Business, Premium (monthly or yearly), plus Enterprise. Paid plans start at $19/month and all paid tiers include the same features; they differ by included credits and overage pricing. Paid adds company data, extended ASN, Security and Abuse modules, user-agent in the unified response, localized responses, the dedicated IP Security, ASN, and IP Abuse Contact APIs, and Real-Time VPN and Proxy Detection. See [API Pricing](https://ipgeolocation.io/pricing.html).
- Rate limits: no per-second or per-minute rate limits on any plan. HTTP 429 is returned only when the plan's quota is used up.
- Credits: a standard IP lookup costs 1 credit; adding Security costs +2 and Abuse Contact costs +1. See [Credits Usage](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/credits-usage.html).
- API base URL: https://api.ipgeolocation.io/v3/ (for example /v3/ipgeo). Authentication by API key (apiKey), or by Request Origin (CORS) for client-side use on paid plans.
- Data is updated daily. All API endpoints are served over HTTPS, including on the free plan.

