## APIs
- [IP Geolocation API](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-location-api.html): City-level geolocation plus network/ASN, company, currency, time zone, and optional Security, Abuse Contact, and User Agent modules in one unified response. Bulk lookups up to 50,000 IPs per request. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/ip-location-api.html)
- [IP Security API](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-security-api.html): VPN, proxy, residential proxy, Tor, relay, bot, and cloud-provider detection with threat scores. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/ip-security-api.html)
- [Real-Time Proxy & VPN Detection](https://ipgeolocation.io/real-time-proxy-and-vpn-detection.html): Client-side JavaScript that tests the live connection in the browser to flag VPNs, proxies, and residential proxies at login or checkout. Origin-authorized, no API key in the page. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/real-time-proxy-and-vpn-detection.html)
- [ASN API](https://ipgeolocation.io/asn-api.html): ASN details by AS number or IP, with optional routes, peers, upstreams, downstreams, and raw WHOIS. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/asn-api.html)
- [IP Abuse Contact API](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-abuse-contact-api.html): Abuse reporting contacts (emails, phone, organization) for any IP address. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/ip-abuse-contact-api.html)
- [Time Zone API](https://ipgeolocation.io/timezone-api.html): Time zone, local time, and DST by IP, coordinates, address, time zone name, IATA/ICAO airport code, or UN/LOCODE, plus time conversion between locations. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/timezone-api.html)
- [Astronomy API](https://ipgeolocation.io/astronomy-api.html): Sunrise, sunset, twilight, golden/blue hour, moonrise, moonset, and moon phase for a location and date, including date-range time series. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/astronomy-api.html)
- [User Agent API](https://ipgeolocation.io/user-agent-api.html): Parses user-agent strings into structured browser, OS, device, and engine attributes. [Docs](https://ipgeolocation.io/documentation/user-agent-api.html)

## Databases
IPGeolocation.io offers downloadable databases in three bundles: Geo Standard, Security Pro, and Geo Advance. Databases are available in CSV and MMDB, except IP WHOIS and ASN WHOIS, which are delivered as Gzip-compressed newline-delimited JSON; custom formats can be provided on request. Place-name translations (country/state/city) are available in multiple languages. Databases are updated daily or weekly, depending on the update plan. Also available on [Snowflake Marketplace](https://ipgeolocation.io/integrations/snowflake).

Database product pages: [IP Geolocation Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-geolocation-database.html), [IP Security Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-security-database.html), [IP to ASN Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-asn-database.html), [IP to Company Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-company-database.html), [IP Abuse Contact Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-abuse-contact-database.html), [IP WHOIS Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-whois-database.html), [ASN WHOIS Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/asn-whois-database.html), [Residential Proxy Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/residential-proxy-database.html), [IP to Hosting Database](https://ipgeolocation.io/ip-hosting-database.html).

